ey\n代理支持\t默认 127.0.0.1:10808\n扫描范围\t默认 Top-20 主流永续合约\n时间框架\t1H + 4H + 1D 三重验证\n指标体系\tMA排列 / MACD金叉 / RSI / 布林带 / 量能 / 动量\n输出\tHTML可视化报告 + JSON原始数据\n使用方法扫描三重共振\" / \"有三重共振信号吗\" / \"找多周期共振标的\"\n\nSkill 会自动触发，执行扫描，生成报告。", "downloads": 44, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_3601a2f8/scgz", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/5a1e9830-80e4-4cbb-8d00-cee893ca9555.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "三重共振扫描", "ownerName": "user_3601a2f8", "score": 11282.051282051283, "slug": "scgz", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780381961532, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779355672674, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 44, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_d1c8ae9c/zh-quotes", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7f79eb60-b8d8-4d8e-9b79-6ace0de1ff17.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "zh-quotes", "ownerName": "user_d1c8ae9c", "score": 4746.4940668824165, "slug": "zh-quotes", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780381961513, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779207582611, "description": "扫描项目中的 TODO/FIXME/HACK/XXX/NOTE 注释，按文件、标签类型、优先级汇总成结构化报告", "description_zh": "扫描项目中的 TODO/FIXME/HACK/XXX/NOTE 注释，按文件、标签类型、优先级汇总成结构化报告", "downloads": 44, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_5aa6b640/todo-scanner", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/cab3c5ed-3acd-4936-a59b-5f0c5f5dab1b.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "jm-jsjkxyjs02-wyc-1301", "ownerName": "user_5aa6b640", "score": 4746.4940668824165, "slug": "todo-scanner", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780381961510, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779008887996, "description": "智能文件整理器：自动按文件类型分类整理指定文