ce)\n- Good news/bad news communication strategies\n\nApplicable for affiliate AM teams managing partners across multiple cultural backgrounds, reducing email round-trips by 80%.", "description_zh": "Cross-Cultural Negotiation Copilot | 跨文化谈判智能助手", "downloads": 43, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_ede7f505/cross-cultural-communication-engine", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/9bcddb03-161b-42cd-bf2e-cf0159d85bd7.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "🤝 Cross-Cultural Negotiation Copilot | 跨文化谈判智能助手", "ownerName": "user_ede7f505", "score": 602.7474067844126, "slug": "cross-cultural-communication-engine", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780387660681, "version": "1.0.0"}]}